"concept", "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every fill is declared twice in a style attribute: an sRGB hex fallback first (e.g. #7e14ff) followed by `fill:color(display-p3 ...)` with a longer float form. This is the Figma SVG-export pattern \u2014 the hex keeps the mark correct on older renderers, the P3 value renders the more saturated gradient on wide-gamut displays."}, {"id": "public_favicon_browser_tab_identity", "label": "Browser Tab / Bookmark Identity", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The asset is served at /favicon.svg and referenced from index.html as `type=\"image/svg+xml\"`, so its only job is identification in a 16x16 browser-tab slot and in bookmark lists. That is why the design is a single bold silhouette with a flat gradient and no text: shapes that survive being shrunk to favicon scale."}, {"id": "public_favicon_template_residue", "label": "Vite Template Residue (Unmodified Default Asset)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "public_favicon", "target": "public_favicon_abstract_v_bolt_glyph", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "public_favicon", "target": "public_favicon_vite_brand_purple", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "public_favicon", "target": "public_favicon_alpha_mask", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "public/